    "body": "ZORR Three-Chat SHERIFF Hard Control R01 + Morning Wake Contract.\n\nSTATUS = CI_PASS_CANDIDATE / DRAFT / NOT MERGED.\n\nScope:\n- universal `studio/ZORR_SHERIFF_THREE_CHAT_LAW_R01.md` for CHAT A/B/C;\n- fail-closed `scripts/validate_three_chat_sheriff.py` wired into existing `hq-validate`;\n- `studio/ZORR_MORNING_BOOTSTRAP_R01.md` so OWNER can return after being offline and start a fresh A/B/C chat without manually relaying durable context;\n- master/orchestration wiring for SHERIFF + morning recovery.\n\nTDD evidence for morning addition:\n- RED HEAD `0633f34edf2716a1157dbd3c0232ec2988a41f5e`: hq-validate run `33447342819`, `hq-schema = FAILURE` at full unittest step while existing SHERIFF validator passed.\n- GREEN verified candidate HEAD `bfd693fa563a5fba7869ee5adabe23a9d9ce5aec`: hq-validate #870 / run `33447507505 = SUCCESS`, all 3 jobs SUCCESS; SHERIFF validator + full unittest suite SUCCESS.\n\nWake commands are distributed in trackers #249/#250/#251 as well as the morning file so a fresh chat can discover them before this PR is merged.\n\nNo new daemon/framework, no image execution, no production mutation, and no merge performed. Any HEAD written here is checkpoint evidence only; fresh-read GitHub before promotion.",
